<span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="color:black">Hello {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},</span><br />
<br />
To recognise your ongoing loyalty as a Qantas Platinum One member, we would love to thank you by inviting you to experience the Qantas Chairmans Lounge ahead of your flight on <strong>(eg: 20th June 2025)</strong>.<br />
<br />
This one-time invitation grants you and a guest, travelling on the same flight as you, entry into our most exclusive lounge. It is the perfect spot to relax, dine, or catch up on work in total comfort before boarding your flight from Melbourne.<br />
<br />
Your details are already registered with our Chairmans Lounge hosts, who look forward to welcoming you at the Chairmans Lounge&nbsp;located&nbsp;in the Qantas Melbourne Lounge Precinct.<br />
<br />
<strong>Please keep the following guidelines in mind before your visit:</strong></span></span>
<ul>
	<li><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Privacy: To maintain exclusivity and protect the privacy of our guests, photos and videos are strictly prohibited.</span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Guests: Your guest must be 18 years of age or older.</span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Validity: This access is unique to you and is only valid for the date and location listed above.</span></span></li>
</ul>
<span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"> Thank you again for flying with us. We hope you have a fantastic experience.<br />
<br />
